":\"Samples recorded for this procedure\",\"ar\":\"العينات المسجلة لهذا الإجراء\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"records.RK-SAMPLE.for.P-REV-012\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_rev_012_evidence\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Evidence links citing this procedure\",\"ar\":\"روابط الأدلة التي تستشهد بهذا الإجراء\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"records.RK-EVIDENCE-LINK.for.P-REV-012\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_rev_012_conclusion\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Conclusion\",\"ar\":\"الاستنتاج\"},\"type\":\"select\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"value\":\"performed_no_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, no exception\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ دون استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"performed_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, exception noted\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ مع ملاحظة استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"not_applicable\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Not applicable, reason stated\",\"ar\":\"لا ينطبق، مع بيان السبب\"}}]}],\"note\":{\"en\":\"Evaluate unbilled revenue, deferred revenue and customer advances.\",\"ar\":\"Evaluate unbilled revenue, deferred revenue and customer advances.\"}},{\"id\":\"p_rev_013\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"P-REV-013 Revenue completeness through external records\",\"ar\":\"P-REV-013 اكتمال الإيرادات من خلال السجلات الخارجية\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"p_rev_013_work\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Work performed\",\"ar\":\"العمل المنفذ\"},\"type\":\"textarea\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"p_rev_013_result\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Results and exceptions\",\"ar\":\"النتائج والاستثناءات\"},\"type\":\"textarea\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"p_rev_013_samples\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Samples recorded for this procedure\",\"ar\":\"العينات المسجلة لهذا الإجراء\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"records.RK-SAMPLE.for.P-REV-013\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_rev_013_evidence\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Evidence links citing this procedure\",\"ar\":\"روابط الأدلة التي تستشهد بهذا الإجراء\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"records.RK-EVIDENCE-LINK.for.P-REV-013\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_rev_013_conclusion\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Conclusion\",\"ar\":\"الاستنتاج\"},\"type\":\"select\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"value\":\"performed_no_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, no exception\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ دون استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"performed_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, exception noted\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ مع ملاحظة استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"not_applicable\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Not applicable, reason stated\",\"ar\":\"لا ينطبق، مع بيان السبب\"}}]}],\"note\":{\"en\":\"Test completeness from populations outside the sales ledger.\",\"ar\":\"Test completeness from populations outside the sales ledger.\"}},{\"id\":\"sch_rec\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Movement schedule: Trade receivables (LS-REC)\",\"ar\":\"جدول الحركة: Trade receivables (LS-REC)\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"sch_rec\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Trade receivables movement schedule\",\"ar\":\"جدول حركة Trade receivables\"},\"type\":\"table\",\"required\":false,\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"component\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Component\",\"ar\":\"المكوّن\"},\"type\":\"select\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"value\":\"gross_receivables\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Gross receivables\",\"ar\":\"المدينون الإجماليون\"}},{\"value\":\"loss_allowance\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Loss allowance\",\"ar\":\"مخصص الخسائر الائتمانية\"}}]},{\"id\":\"opening\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Opening balance\",\"ar\":\"الرصيد الافتتاحي\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"additions\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Invoiced\",\"ar\":\"المفوتر\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"disposals\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Collected\",\"ar\":\"المحصل\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"transfers\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Transfers and reclassifications\",\"ar\":\"التحويلات وإعادة التبويب\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"revaluation\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Revaluation or remeasurement\",\"ar\":\"إعادة التقييم أو إعادة القياس\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"other\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Written off and allowance movements\",\"ar\":\"المشطوب وحركة المخصص\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"closing\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Closing balance\",\"ar\":\"الرصيد الختامي\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":true}]},{\"id\":\"sch_rec_difference\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Difference between the closing total and the leadsheet\",\"ar\":\"الفرق بين الإجمالي الختامي والورقة الرئيسية\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-REC.difference\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"sch_rec_agrees\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Schedule agrees to the leadsheet\",\"ar\":\"الجدول يتفق مع الورقة الرئيسية\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-REC.agrees\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"sch_rec_opening_difference\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Difference between the opening total and the prior period\",\"ar\":\"الفرق بين الإجمالي الافتتاحي والفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.rollforward.schedules.SCH-REC.opening_difference\",\"readonly\":true}],\"note\":{\"en\":\"Gross receivables and the loss allowance reconciled from the opening to the closing balance. Required by IFRS 7.35H and 7.35I. Closing balance = opening + additions - disposals + transfers + revaluation + other for every component; Loss allowance is stated positive and deducted. The closing total must equal the adjusted balance of Trade and other receivables (LS-REC) read above; the paper computes the schedule and shows the difference.\",\"ar\":\"يشترطه IFRS 7.35H and 7.35I. الرصيد الختامي = الافتتاحي + الإضافات - الاستبعادات + التحويلات + إعادة التقييم + أخرى لكل مكوّن؛ ويُذكر المكوّن المقابل موجباً ويُخصم. يجب أن يساوي الإجمالي الختامي الرصيد المعدّل لـ Trade and other receivables (LS-REC) المقروء أعلاه؛ وتحسب الورقة الجدول وتعرض الفرق.\"}}],\"signoff\":{\"prepare\":[\"partner\",\"manager\",\"senior\",\"staff\"],\"review\":[\"partner\",\"manager\"],\"approve\":[\"partner\"]},\"computation\":\"rollforward\",\"version\":2,\"ar_status\":\"draft_pending_review\"}"),
    ("F32-PURCHASES-PAYABLES", "{\"id\":\"F32-PURCHASES-PAYABLES\",\"number\":32,\"kind\":\"worksheet\",\"phase\":\"fieldwork\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Purchases, payables and expenditure working paper\",\"ar\":\"ورقة عمل المشتريات والدائنين والمصروفات\"},\"purpose\":{\"en\":\"Document every substantive procedure of the purchases, payables and expenditure cycle: the work, the results, the evidence and the conclusion, against the balances the trial balance holds.\",\"ar\":\"توثيق كل إجراء أساسي في دورة المشتريات والدائنين والمصروفات: العمل والنتائج والأدلة والاستنتاج، مقابل الأرصدة الواردة في ميزان المراجعة.\"},\"procedures\":[\"P-PUR-003\",\"P-PUR-004\",\"P-PUR-005\",\"P-PUR-006\",\"P-PUR-007\",\"P-PUR-008\",\"P-PUR-010\",\"P-PUR-011\",\"P-PUR-012\"],\"standards\":[\"ISA-330\",\"ISA-500\",\"ISA-505\",\"ISA-520\",\"ISA-530\",\"ISA-540\"],\"sections\":[{\"id\":\"engagement\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Engagement\",\"ar\":\"الارتباط\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"client\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Entity audited\",\"ar\":\"المنشأة محل المراجعة\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.client\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"period_start\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Period from\",\"ar\":\"الفترة من\"},\"type\":\"date\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.period_start\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"period_end\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Period to\",\"ar\":\"الفترة إلى\"},\"type\":\"date\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.period_end\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"framework\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Financial reporting framework\",\"ar\":\"إطار التقرير المالي\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"engagement.framework\",\"readonly\":true}]},{\"id\":\"balances\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"Balances, materiality and risks\",\"ar\":\"الأرصدة والأهمية النسبية والمخاطر\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"performance_materiality\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performance materiality\",\"ar\":\"مادية الأداء\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.materiality.performance\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"clearly_trivial\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Clearly trivial threshold\",\"ar\":\"حد المبالغ التافهة بشكل واضح\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"paper.materiality.clearly_trivial\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_prep\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Prepayments (LS-PREP)\",\"ar\":\"Prepayments (LS-PREP)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-PREP\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_prep_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Prepayments, prior period\",\"ar\":\"Prepayments، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-PREP.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_provnc\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Provisions (non-current) (LS-PROVNC)\",\"ar\":\"Provisions (non-current) (LS-PROVNC)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-PROVNC\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_provnc_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Provisions (non-current), prior period\",\"ar\":\"Provisions (non-current)، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-PROVNC.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_oncl\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Other non-current liabilities (LS-ONCL)\",\"ar\":\"Other non-current liabilities (LS-ONCL)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-ONCL\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_oncl_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Other non-current liabilities, prior period\",\"ar\":\"Other non-current liabilities، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-ONCL.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_ap\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Trade payables (LS-AP)\",\"ar\":\"Trade payables (LS-AP)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-AP\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_ap_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Trade payables, prior period\",\"ar\":\"Trade payables، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-AP.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_accr\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Accruals and other payables (LS-ACCR)\",\"ar\":\"Accruals and other payables (LS-ACCR)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-ACCR\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_accr_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Accruals and other payables, prior period\",\"ar\":\"Accruals and other payables، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-ACCR.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_provc\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Provisions (current) (LS-PROVC)\",\"ar\":\"Provisions (current) (LS-PROVC)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-PROVC\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_provc_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Provisions (current), prior period\",\"ar\":\"Provisions (current)، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-PROVC.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_opex\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Operating expenses (LS-OPEX)\",\"ar\":\"Operating expenses (LS-OPEX)\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-OPEX\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"ls_opex_prior\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Operating expenses, prior period\",\"ar\":\"Operating expenses، الفترة السابقة\"},\"type\":\"money\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"tb.leadsheet.LS-OPEX.prior\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"risks\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Risks placed on this cycle by the risk register\",\"ar\":\"المخاطر الموضوعة على هذه الدورة في سجل المخاطر\"},\"type\":\"table\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"form.F04-RISK-REGISTER.risks\",\"readonly\":true,\"columns\":[{\"id\":\"risk\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Risk\",\"ar\":\"الخطر\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"level\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Level\",\"ar\":\"المستوى\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"assertions\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Assertions affected\",\"ar\":\"الإقرارات المتأثرة\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"inherent_risk\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Inherent risk\",\"ar\":\"الخطر الملازم\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"significant\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Significant risk\",\"ar\":\"خطر مهم\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"control_risk\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Control risk\",\"ar\":\"خطر الرقابة\"},\"type\":\"text\",\"required\":false},{\"id\":\"response\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Planned response\",\"ar\":\"الاستجابة المخططة\"},\"type\":\"textarea\",\"required\":false}]}],\"note\":{\"en\":\"Balances are read from the latest accepted trial balance and frozen when the paper is prepared; a later import marks them as drifted.\",\"ar\":\"تُقرأ الأرصدة من أحدث ميزان مراجعة مقبول وتُثبت عند إعداد الورقة؛ ويؤدي استيراد لاحق إلى وسمها بأنها تغيرت.\"}},{\"id\":\"p_pur_003\",\"title\":{\"en\":\"P-PUR-003 Search for unrecorded liabilities\",\"ar\":\"P-PUR-003 البحث عن الالتزامات غير المسجلة\"},\"fields\":[{\"id\":\"p_pur_003_work\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Work performed\",\"ar\":\"العمل المنفذ\"},\"type\":\"textarea\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"p_pur_003_result\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Results and exceptions\",\"ar\":\"النتائج والاستثناءات\"},\"type\":\"textarea\",\"required\":true},{\"id\":\"p_pur_003_samples\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Samples recorded for this procedure\",\"ar\":\"العينات المسجلة لهذا الإجراء\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"records.RK-SAMPLE.for.P-PUR-003\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_pur_003_evidence\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Evidence links citing this procedure\",\"ar\":\"روابط الأدلة التي تستشهد بهذا الإجراء\"},\"type\":\"integer\",\"required\":false,\"autofill\":\"records.RK-EVIDENCE-LINK.for.P-PUR-003\",\"readonly\":true},{\"id\":\"p_pur_003_conclusion\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Conclusion\",\"ar\":\"الاستنتاج\"},\"type\":\"select\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"value\":\"performed_no_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, no exception\",\"ar\":\"نُفذ دون استثناء\"}},{\"value\":\"performed_exception\",\"label\":{\"en\":\"Performed, ex